    <briefdescription>
<para>A live cross-process export of a device buffer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holds the descriptor a consumer needs to map the buffer. There is no cross-process refcount: the consumer&apos;s mapping stays valid only while this object is alive. </para>
